.megaplan/initiatives/native-workflow-platformization/PLATFORM_CONTRACT.md:1005:| `PWC-AF-33` | Effective profile closure | Required profiles derive from actual topology/lock/bindings; an independent deriver and per-capability inclusion/removal/rebind mutations catch under-derivation; changes invalidate and recompute receipts before admission, rebind/migration, substitution, and publication. | S1, S2A, S5, S6 |
