codex
The crosswalk enrichment is mechanical but important: every one of the 83 preserved requirements is being bound to an exact hashed source slice, exact active milestone labels, and concrete gate/proof IDs. This removes the last gap between “we described where the work went” and “the bootstrap can verify where the work went.”
